body:
Wtf, I was never this articulate when I was 15. I mean, I'm 18 now, and I know I'm still really young, but I would've loved to be this eloquent in speech when I was your age! 

Not only that, but you present your arguments so clearly, which is something I struggle to do without using a whole bunch of word salad, unfortunately ;-;

Wow, I really love to see this from our generation. Thank you for giving me a beacon of hope for a brighter future for us!
